'''Lake Sui''' was a [[lake]] located on the [[Forest]] [[moon]] of [[Endor]]. The lake was surrounded by forest and was home to multiple villages that were [[Ewok stilt village|built on stilts]] and inhabited by the moon's [[Homeworld|native]] [[Ewok]] [[species]].<ref name="CL 2016" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, [[Lake Sui/Legends|Lake Sui]] first appeared in the reference book ''[[Inside the Worlds of Star Wars Trilogy]]''.<ref name="ItWoSWT">''[[Inside the Worlds of Star Wars Trilogy]]''</ref> It was first mentioned in the new [[canon]] continuity in the [[2016]] reference book [[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']].<ref name="CL 2016" />

